pan class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkT\">syrkT</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <span class=\"fn\">C</span>)</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a>   <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">if</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">uplo</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo.contains\">contains</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">then</a>\n    <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">if</a> (<span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq.beq\">==</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">then</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Loop.html#BLAS.Float32.betaMul\">betaMul</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <span class=\"fn\">C</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a></span>\n    <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">else</a>       <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">if</a> (<span class=\"fn\">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq.beq\">==</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.and\">&amp;&amp;</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq.beq\">==</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">then</a> <span class=\"fn\">C</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a>\n      <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">else</a>         <span class=\"fn\">have <span class=\"fn\">t</span> := <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">k</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/Fold.html#Nat.fold\">fold</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(fun (<span class=\"fn\">l</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) (<span class=\"fn\">hl</span> : <span class=\"fn\">l</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>) (<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">l</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">l</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span></span>;\n        <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">if</a> (<span class=\"fn\">β</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq.beq\">==</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">then</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">t</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">else</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">t</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">C</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a></span>\n  <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">else</a> <span class=\"fn\">C</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Element `(i, j)` of `syrkT uplo α A β C` in the triangle `uplo` is `betaMul β C[i, j]` when\n`α = 0`, `C[i, j]` when `k = 0` and `β = 1`, and otherwise `α * t`, when `β = 0`, or\n`α * t + β * C[i, j]`, where `t` is the sum of the products `A[l, i] * A[l, j]` for\n`l = 0, …, k - 1`, from the left. The other elements are those of `C`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.getElem_syrkT","kind":"theorem","line":907,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.getElem_syrkT","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L907-L933"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.ld_syrkT\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">ld_syrkT</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkT\">syrkT</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <span class=\"fn\">C</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.ld\">ld</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">C</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.ld\">ld</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.ld_syrkT","kind":"theorem","line":901,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.ld_syrkT","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L901-L905"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.off_syrkT\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">off_syrkT</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkT\">syrkT</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <span class=\"fn\">C</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.off\">off</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">C</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.off\">off</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.off_syrkT","kind":"theorem","line":895,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.off_syrkT","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L895-L899"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.data_syrkT\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">data_syrkT</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkT\">syrkT</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <span class=\"fn\">C</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.data\">data</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.mapMat\">mapMat</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">C</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.data\">data</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">C</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.off\">off</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">C</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.ld\">ld</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTEntryAt\">syrkTEntryAt</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The array of `syrkT uplo α A β C` is the array of `C` with its triangle updated.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.data_syrkT","kind":"theorem","line":885,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.data_syrkT","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L885-L893"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkT\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">syrkT</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`syrkT uplo α A β C` is `α * Aᵀ * A + β * C`, on the triangle `uplo` of `C`, by the loops of the\nreference BLAS: for each element `(i, j)` of the triangle, it sums the products `A[l, i] * A[l, j]`\nfor `l = 0, …, k - 1` from the left, into `t`, then writes `α * t + β * C[i, j]`, or `α * t`\nwithout reading `C[i, j]` when `β = 0`. It computes the sums of four elements of a column in each\npass over column `j` of `A`, by the loops of `gemvT`, which gives the same sums and lets their\nadditions overlap. As in the reference BLAS, it only scales `C` when `α = 0`,\nand returns `C` when `k = 0` and `β = 1`. It updates `C` in place when its array is not shared,\nand leaves the elements of the array outside the triangle unchanged.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkT","kind":"def","line":859,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkT","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L859-L883"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTEntryAt\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">syrkTEntryAt</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The value of `syrkT` in the triangle `uplo`, and the old value elsewhere, with the special cases of\nthe reference BLAS: `betaMul β v` when `α = 0`, and `v` when `k = 0` and `β = 1`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTEntryAt","kind":"def","line":849,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTEntryAt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L849-L857"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTData_eq\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">syrkTData_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_arg