a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The value of the loops of `syrkT` at an element of the triangle, from the sum `t` of its products\nand its old value `v`: `α * t` when `β = 0`, without reading `v`, and `α * t + β * v` otherwise.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTVal","kind":"def","line":717,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTVal","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L717-L722"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTSum\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">syrkTSum</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The sum of the products `A[l, i] * A[l, j]` for `l = 0, …, k - 1`, from the left.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTSum","kind":"def","line":713,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTSum","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L713-L715"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"