 <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq.beq\">==</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">then</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">else</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">l</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">l</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a>)</span>\n        <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Loop.html#BLAS.Float32.betaMul\">betaMul</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <span class=\"fn\">C</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a>)</span></span>\n  <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ite\">else</a> <span class=\"fn\">C</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Element `(i, j)` of `syrk uplo α A β C` in the triangle `uplo` is `betaMul β C[i, j]` when `α = 0`,\nand otherwise `betaMul β C[i, j]`, plus the terms `α * A[j, l] * A[i, l]` for `l = 0, …, k - 1`,\nadded from the left, except those with `A[j, l] = 0`. The other elements are those of `C`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.getElem_syrk","kind":"theorem","line":633,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.getElem_syrk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L633-L655"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.ld_syrk\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">ld_syrk</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"