5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L97-L103"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTerm\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">syrkTerm</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">l </span><span class=\"fn\">i </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The term `l` of the loops of `syrk` at `(i, j)`, added to `s`, on the arrays: `s` when `α = 0` or\n`A[j, l] = 0`, which the reference BLAS skips, and `s + α * A[j, l] * A[i, l]` otherwise.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Syrk.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTerm","kind":"def","line":89,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.syrkTerm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Syrk.lean#L89-L95"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">the